  "html": "\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull prototype-main about-prototype has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide editorial-section editorial-grid is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading screen-reader-text\">About</h1>\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group cv-section-heading is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-79fb870f wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-index\">Biography</h2>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group cv-biography is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-image cv-biography__media\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/portfolio-theme/assets/images/cv/po-hao-chen-performance.webp\" alt=\"PO HAO CHEN 現場演出，操作電子音樂設備\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1500\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group cv-biography__content is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading cv-biography__name\">PO HAO CHEN</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cv-biography__role wp-block-paragraph\">MUSIC PRODUCER / SOUND ARTIST</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group cv-biography__copy is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">畢業於國立臺南藝術大學應用音樂學系工程與創作組，曾任智冠科技音樂製作人，現以獨立音樂工作者身分投入配樂、音樂製作、現場演出與跨域展演。</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">合作與製作經歷包括香港 Madhead《神魔之塔》、日本 SEGA、台鋼獵鷹、台鋼天鷹、公視金 V 獎，以及多位 VTuber 與歌手；2026 年初亦擔任歌手 E1and 專場演出的音樂總監，負責整體音樂策劃與演出統籌。近年積極參與聲音藝術與跨領域創作，曾於聲響藝術節演出。</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">目前主要從事詞曲創作、編曲、配唱製作、吉他與貝斯演奏、混音、現場音樂總監、現場音樂執行及音樂教學等工作。</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\t\n\n\t\n\t<div id=\"cv-placeholder\" class=\"wp-block-group alignwide editorial-section editorial-grid cv-timeline is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group cv-section-heading is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-79fb870f wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-index\">Selected Experience</h2>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group section-body-block is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"wp-block-list cv-timeline__list cv-experience__list\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cv-experience__row\"><strong class=\"cv-experience__year\">2019</strong><span class=\"cv-experience__description\">ROD 遊戲全配樂（作曲、編曲、混音）</span></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cv-experience__row\"><strong class=\"cv-experience__year\">2019</strong><span class=\"cv-experience__description\">真理大學畢業歌（吉他、製作人、配唱、合聲）</span></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cv-experience__row\"><strong class=\"cv-experience__year\">2020</strong><span class=\"cv-experience__description\">黃易群俠傳 M 多首遊戲配樂（作曲、編曲、吉他、混音）</span></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cv-experience__row\"><strong class=\"cv-experience__year\">2021</strong><span class=\"cv-experience__description\">哇賽心理學節目配樂（作曲、編曲、吉他）</span></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cv-experience__row\"><strong class=\"cv-experience__year\">2022</strong><span class=\"cv-experience__description\">泡泡（吉他、製作協力）</span></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cv-experience__row\"><strong class=\"cv-experience__year\">2022</strong><span class=\"cv-experience__description\">Canine — Fantasizing（製作人、作曲、編曲、吉他、配唱、混音、母帶）</span></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cv-experience__row\"><strong class=\"cv-experience__year\">2022</strong><span class=\"cv-experience__description\">WAY EP《Someway 某》（混音、製作人）</span></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cv-experience__row\"><strong class=\"cv-experience__year\">2023</strong><span class=\"cv-experience__description\">神魔之塔十週年主題曲《與你相遇》（吉